Z||000000||Elenor84||12-13-2000||02:08 AM||||Hey guys...I just put a 10 inch sub behind the passenger seat in a truck box...it rocks!  Sound is awesome...but I did sacrifice some room for the passenger...but its not bad.  The amp is behind drivers seat.  The wires to the sub I put behind the center console threw the grills.  The wires to the deck I ran up in the center console all the way to the front...I installed everything my self...this isn't the most professional job but it works just as good.  Anyone looking for a decent sound system without spending alot of coin I really suggest this...Anyways...if u want more details email me!  And ask questions please!<P>------------------<BR>Lance||||reg||10
